TI  - Evaluation of the recursive model approach for estimating particulate matter infiltration efficiencies using continuous light scattering data
PY  - 2007
T2  - Journal of Exposure Science and Environmental Epidemiology
VL  - 17
IS  - 5
SP  - 468
