TI  - Estimated hourly personal exposures to ambient and nonambient particulate matter among sensitive populations in seattle, washington
PY  - 2004
T2  - Journal of the Air and Waste Management Association
VL  - 54
IS  - 9
SP  - 1197
EP  - 1211
DO  - 10.1080/10473289.2004.10470988
