TI  - Relation between short-term fine-particulate matter exposure and onset of myocardial infarction
PY  - 2005
T2  - Epidemiology
VL  - 16
IS  - 1
SP  - 41
EP  - 48
DO  - 10.1097/01.ede.0000147116.34813.56
